<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐᾱκονθ-ήμερος</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of thirty days,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).532
				</span></i>
			 (Epid.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.28.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				48
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐηκοντήμερος</span></b> , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.4
				</span></i>
			: but 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐᾱκοντάμερος</span></b> , τό (q. v.), is perh. a different word.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριακονθήμερον, τό,</span>
			<i>a time of thirty days,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				21.13.12
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>thirty days old,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοιρίδιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					478
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
